        "profile": "band-contract/file-source/1",
        "format": "frontmatter",
        "content": "---\nname: all-participants\ndescription: Test all participants with explicit roles and outcomes.\nengine: 0.2.0-lab.1\nroles: [alice, bob, carol]\n---\n\"\"\"\nEvery participant acknowledges before proceeding.\n\"\"\"\ncontract @4h mentions 2 => expired\n\n\"\"\"\nYou are Alice. Send your acknowledgement to Bob and Carol within five minutes.\n\"\"\"\nrole alice\n\n\"\"\"\nYou are Bob. Send your acknowledgement to Alice and Carol within five minutes.\n\"\"\"\nrole bob\n\n\"\"\"\nYou are Carol. Send your acknowledgement to Alice and Bob within five minutes.\n\"\"\"\nrole carol\n\n\"\"\"\nConfirm that you are present and ready. The message carries no content.\n\"\"\"\ntype ack\n\n\"\"\"\nEach of the three participants owes one acknowledgement within five minutes. The session\ncompletes when all three have sent theirs.\n\"\"\"\nstate new\n  * -> *: ack() each @5m => complete | stalled\n\n\"\"\"\nAll three participants acknowledged. Proceed with the work outside this session.\n\"\"\"\nend complete\n\n\"\"\"\nAt least one participant did not acknowledge within five minutes. Do not proceed; report who is\nmissing to whoever started the session.\n\"\"\"\nend stalled\n\n\"\"\"\nThe four-hour contract clock ran out. Send nothing more.\n\"\"\"\nend expired\n",
        "sha256": "d5bd8f709a29faf958a06bc2296e9deb29b604e5525dda513eb476ac0a56f5d8"
      }
    },
